    <string name="privacy_body">OTP Vault stores everything locally on your device. It has no internet permission, no analytics, no ads and no cloud backend. OTP codes, phone numbers and notes are encrypted with AES-256-GCM using a key protected by the Android Keystore. Your PIN is never stored; only a salted, stretched verifier is kept. Expired OTPs are deleted automatically. Encrypted backups are created only when you choose a file and a password, and are never uploaded automatically.</string>
